  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve the best impact, we are prioritizing areas of high hunger and malnutrition rates, such as Samar Island, and the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao.  We provide Immediate solutions like the provision of food baskets for hungry children &amp; their families; Cash transfers  for food and livelihood; Sustainable solutions such as promoting positive behaviors and practices among parents and and caregivers at home, resulting to better nutrition for their children.</narrative>
